sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Placement officer
    actor S as Student
    participant PL as placement-service
    participant AS as assessment
    participant BA as batch
    participant CE as certificate
    participant FS as file-service
    participant K as Kafka
    participant NO as notification
    participant RP as reporting

    P->>PL: add company, create job (DRAFT) with eligibility rules
    P->>PL: publish (DRAFT -> OPEN)
    PL->>K: job-posted
    K->>NO: fan out a notification
    K->>RP: dashboard fact

    S->>FS: upload resume (category RESUME, owner + staff + PLACEMENT may read)
    S->>PL: apply to a job
    PL->>BA: batch and attendance
    PL->>AS: test results
    PL->>CE: certificate status
    alt not eligible, or job not OPEN, or already applied
        PL-->>S: refused with the reason
    else eligible
        PL->>PL: application APPLIED + stage history row (same transaction)
        PL->>K: application-stage-changed
    end

    loop pipeline
        P->>PL: move stage (only allowed moves)
        PL->>PL: write stage history, publish audit
        PL->>K: application-stage-changed
        K->>RP: counts
        K->>NO: tell the student
    end
    Note over PL: SELECTED, REJECTED and WITHDRAWN are final
    P->>FS: download the resume
    P->>PL: close the job (OPEN -> CLOSED)
